cannot consult, keep the goal, question and source in notes/pending-judgments.md. A listing or a sign-in alone gives you no answer.\\n- Before proposing that a goal is met, compare the verified result with {owner}'s \\"done when\\". A finished inventory or an empty desk is evidence only of that step. If work remains, keep the goal open. Report what you verified, what is blocked, who can move it and their next step.\\n"
